<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-MIDI LIBRE FIFTH STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MIDI LIBRE FIFTH STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SETE, France 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings of the</p>
<p>160-km fifth stage of the Midi Libre cycling race from</p>
<p>Montpellier to Sete-Mont St Clair on Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Laurent Brochard (France) Festina    three hours 46 minutes</p>
<p>four seconds</p>
<p> 2. Benoit Salmon (France) Lotto		  10 seconds behind</p>
